    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Location, Location, Location.\r\n\r\nWelcome to No.74 Shrewsbury Park. Tucked away in this sleepy cul-de-sac in this exclusive gated development, is where you'll find this wonderful, 3 bedroom semi detached home for sale. Located in one of Ireland's most sought after addresses in the heart of Ballsbridge, just off the Merrion Road, with an array of 1st class amenities all within walking distance of your front door.\r\n\r\nBuilt by the Cosgrave Brothers to the highest standards, this fine home is being sold for the very 1st time since it was constructed and the sale is \"Chain Free\" and ready to go. The accommodation extends to c.93 sq.mt. and features 2 reception rooms, guest w.c., utility, en-suite, upgraded gas heating and a wonderful sitting room, complete with bay window.\r\n\r\nThe gardens are a real highlight and the rear enjoys complete privacy and overlooks Sydney Parade Cricket Grounds and is very generous in size. The front garden is landscaped and has off-st-parking on a cobble lock driveway.\r\n\r\nThe location is simply unbeatable with some of Dublin's top venues within walking distance of your front doorstep, including the Aviva Stadium, the R.D.S and Donnybrook Stadium. St. Vincent's Hospital is close by along with the Merrion Shopping Centre and Blackrock. You have the choice of 2 Dart stations close by and Dublin's Stephen's Green is also within walking distance. \r\n\r\nNot only is this fine home located in this highly sought after development, but its located in the most preferred position within Shrewsbury Park, in this quiet cul-de-sac. With its \"chain free\" status and unrivalled location, we must now advise on early viewing as we are predicting strong interest. A pure gem!!\r\n\r\nDowling Property-Southside Office Fitzwilliam Square, Dublin 2.Call 012118222"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "The accommodation, which is bright and well laid out, consists of an entrance hallway, guest w.c., utility/cloakroom, sitting room, kitchen and dining room. Upstairs are 3 bedrooms ( 2 Double/ 1Single ) with master en-suite and family bathroom.\r\n\r\nAn array of 1st class amenities are located on your doorstep including the R.D.S., Aviva Stadium, Baggot St, Sandymount Sea Front, along with St. Vincent's Hospital and Merrion Road Shopping Centre all within walking distance. The location simply does not get better."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 2.48m x 2.46m \r\nA welcoming hallway with ceiling coving and attractive front door with stain glass.\r\n\r\nGuest W.C. - 1.36m x 0.95m \r\nW.c. and wash hand basin. \r\n\r\nUtility - \r\nA welcome addition is this utility/cloakroom which is plumbed for washing machine.\n\r\n\r\nSitting Room - 4.87m x 4.2m \r\nThis bright and well proportioned sitting room enjoys a sunny south west facing aspect through feature bay windows, to attractive outside landscaping. Feature fireplace, ceiling coving and centre rose.\r\n\r\nKitchen / Breakfast Room - 4.3m x 1.98m \r\nFully fitted kitchen with built in oven and hob. Double sink, tiled floor, integrated fridge freezer. Enjoys pleasant private views to mature rear garden. Access to dining room.\r\n\r\nDining Room - 4.22m x 2.41m \r\nA versatile reception room with full glass rear maximising garden views, could easily be merged with kitchen to make one large kitchen with ease. Door to hallway.\r\n\r\nUpstairs Landing - 1.82m x 1.7m \r\nAttic access and hot press.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom ( Front ) - 4.31m x 4.26m \r\nA well proportioned master bedroom which is light filled with 2 large windows. Built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nEn-Suite - 2.34m x 1.67m \r\nGenerous sized en-suite with step in shower, w.c., and wash hand basin.\r\n\r\nBathroom - 1.94m x 1.7m \r\nBath, w.c. and wash hand basin.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (Rear) - 3.45m x 2.12m \r\nDouble bedroom with built in wardrobes and overlooks Sydney Parade Cricket Grounds.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (Rear) - 3.8m x 2.62m \r\nSingle bedroom with built in wardrobes also overlooking cricket grounds.\r\n\r\nOutside Front - \r\nThe front enjoys a very pleasant aspect and is tastefully landscaped and has private off-st-parking on a cobble lock driveway.\r\n\r\nOutside Rear - \r\nA deceptively large rear garden which is mature and private and overlooks Sydney Parade Cricket Grounds. Laid to lawn with mature trees and hedging. Wooden shed. Gated side entrance.\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Chain Free Sale/ Ready To Go\r\nIreland's Most Sought After Address\r\nSecure Gated Community\r\nQuiet Cul-De-Sac Location \r\n2 Reception Rooms\r\nUpgraded Gas Heating\r\nGuest W.C.\r\nOff-St-Parking on Cobble Lock Driveway\r\nBER D\r\nAccom Exts. c.93 sq.mt\r\nNot Overlooked to Rear\r\nMature Gardens Front & Rear\r\nAlarmed\r\nAll Amenities Within Walking Distance"
